    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Monke</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Monke is an action beat-up. 100 man, 1 Gorilla. Of course they cheated and brought more, but that's no problem.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to Monke dominance, dash and smash all humans in a fast-paced action game utilizing a variety of lightning-fast and brutal attacks with relentless aggression.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Crush: A time trial to defeat the mega humans in your path.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: A relentless push against endless waves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765970/extras/6b49cf793c6af39f762cd2e58fa148be.poster.avif?t=1750735043\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765970/extras/6b49cf793c6af39f762cd2e58fa148be.webm?t=1750735043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2765970/extras/6b49cf793c6af39f762cd2e58fa148be.mp4?t=1750735043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
